	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/gamepad_setup/dead_zones/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="How far the left stick moves before you move. Raise it for a stick that drifts; lower it to start walking sooner. Default is the game's own, 27%.|The touch controls' stick too."/>
		<string text="How far the right stick moves before the view turns. Raise it for a stick that drifts; lower it for finer aim. Default is the game's own, 27%."/>
		<string text="See what each stick reads, and what the game takes from it with the dead zones and shape set here: find a stick's drift, then set its dead zone just past it."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="How much of the left stick's travel at its edge counts as a full push. Raise it for a worn stick that stops short of its edge and never reaches full speed. None is the game's own."/>
		<string text="How much of the right stick's travel at its edge counts as a full push, so a worn stick still turns at full speed and speeds up the turn. None is the game's own."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The shape of the look stick's dead zone. Axial: each direction its own, a square in the middle, as Classic aim. Round: the same whichever way you push, as Modern aim. Auto follows your Aim Style."/>
		<string text="How fast the right stick turns the view while zoomed in, as with a sniper rifle's scope. 1X is the game's own."/>
		<string text="How much the turn speeds up while you hold the right stick at its edge, times the map's own: 1X is the game's own, Off never speeds it up, 2X twice the extra speed.|Both aim styles. The mouse and gyro are not changed."/>
		<string text="How long the turn takes to reach its full speed while you hold the right stick at its edge, times the map's own (1 second on every stock map): 0.5X is twice as quick."/>
		<string text="Modern aim: how far from straight to the side, in degrees, a full push still speeds up the turn. Lower keeps more diagonals from speeding it up."/>
		<string text="Modern aim: how far you push the stick before the turn speeds up. Default is the game's own, as Classic's."/>
	</strings>
</menus>
